## 🚀 How to Run

1. Clone this repository to your local machine.
2. Navigate to any project folder (e.g., `EASY1-HELLO/`).
3. Open the `index.html` file directly in your preferred web browser.
4. No server or additional setup is required—**it runs locally**.

